<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: If it goes well, target's ideoligion certainty will be reduced or they will convert. If it goes badly, they will gain certainty in their old beliefs. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>Si sale bien, la certeza de la ideoligión del objetivo se reducirá o se convertirán. Si sale mal, ganarán certeza en sus viejas creencias.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: room impressiveness -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>impresionabilidad de la sala</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.1.label>recuento de participantes</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.label>impacto social de {PAWN_labelShort}</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!-- EN: speaker's social impact -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.labelAbstract>impacto social del orador</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.labelAbstract>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s expectations -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.label>expectativas de {PAWN_labelShort}</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.label>
  <!-- EN: convertee's expectations -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.labelAbstract>expectativas del converso</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.labelAbstract>
  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Terrible</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! From the first word, it was a fruitless back-and-forth argument. It dragged on for a cringe-inducingly long time. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>¡La {0} fue terrible! Desde la primera palabra, fue una discusión infructuosa de ida y vuelta. Se prolongó durante un tiempo vergonzosamente largo.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Ineffective -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Ineficaz</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was ineffective. Most of the arguments were unclear, and the convertee countered those that made sense. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>La {0} fue ineficaz. La mayoría de los argumentos no estaban claros, y el converso contrarrestó los que tenían sentido.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Effective -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Eficaz</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was effective. The speech not only delivered solid arguments and visibly swayed the convertee's thoughts, but kept the crowd entertained as well. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>La {0} fue eficaz. El discurso no solo entregó argumentos sólidos y visiblemente influyó en los pensamientos del converso, sino que también mantuvo a la multitud entretenida.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Masterful -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Magistral</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was masterful! Old beliefs seemed to dissolve effortlessly and inevitably, and our true knowledge was accepted. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>¡La {0} fue magistral! Las viejas creencias parecían disolverse sin esfuerzo e inevitablemente, y nuestro verdadero conocimiento fue aceptado.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  
</LanguageData>